{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32176","headline":"七夕 · 温庭筠","name":"七夕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸣机札札停金梭，芙蓉澹荡生池波。\n神轩红粉陈香罗，凤低蝉薄愁双蛾。\n微光奕奕凌天河，鸾咽鹤唳飘颻歌。\n弯桥销尽愁奈何，天气骀荡云陂陁。\n平明花木有秋意，露湿彩盘蛛网多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}